## Add a Header

Next, add a title and subtitle to your table for better context and readability.



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
tbl <- tbl |> 
        tab_header(
                title = "Main Title",
                subtitle = "Subtitle"
        )

tbl
```

